function issueMembershipReceipt(token,p){const issuer=assertAdmin_(token);['email','name','faculty','grade'].forEach(k=>{if(!String(p[k]||'').trim())throw new Error('必須項目を入力してください。')});const year=Number(p.fiscalYear)||currentFiscalYear_(),lock=LockService.getScriptLock();lock.waitLock(30000);try{const memberSheet=sheet_('memberDb','Members'),membershipSheet=ensureMembershipYearsSheet_(),email=String(p.email).trim().toLowerCase(),members=objects_(memberSheet);let member=members.find(m=>String(m.Email).trim().toLowerCase()===email);if(member&&objects_(membershipSheet).some(m=>String(m.MemberId)===String(member.MemberId)&&Number(m.FiscalYear)===year))throw new Error(year+'年度の在籍登録と領収証発行は完了しています。');const now=new Date();if(member){const row=members.indexOf(member)+2;memberSheet.getRange(row,2,1,12).setValues([[email,p.name,p.faculty,p.grade,p.department||'',p.graduateSchool||'',p.major||'',p.gender||'',p.lineName||'',p.previousMember||'',member.JoinedAt||now,true]]);}else{member={MemberId:nextMemberId_(members)};memberSheet.appendRow([member.MemberId,email,p.name,p.faculty,p.grade,p.department||'',p.graduateSchool||'',p.major||'',p.gender||'',p.lineName||'',p.previousMember||'',now,true]);}const receiptId=Utilities.getUuid(),membershipId='membership-'+year+'-'+String(member.MemberId).replace(/^member-/,'');sheet_('memberDb','Receipts').appendRow([receiptId,now,issuer,email,p.name,num_(p.amount),year+'年度部費として',year]);membershipSheet.appendRow([membershipId,member.MemberId,year,now,num_(p.amount),receiptId,true]);return{ok:true,memberId:member.MemberId,membershipId:membershipId,receiptId:receiptId,description:year+'年度部費として',message:year+'年度の在籍登録と領収証記録を保存しました。'}}finally{lock.releaseLock()}}

function cancelOverdueCampResponses(){const deadlines={};objects_(sheet_('settingsDb','Events')).forEach(e=>{if(e.Genre==='camp'&&e.PaymentDeadline)deadlines[e.EventId]=new Date(e.PaymentDeadline)});const s=sheet_('campDb','Responses'),v=s.getDataRange().getValues(),now=new Date(),rows=[];for(let i=1;i<v.length;i++)if(deadlines[v[i][2]]&&deadlines[v[i][2]]<now&&v[i][13]==='unpaid'&&!v[i][14])rows.push(i+1);rows.forEach(r=>s.getRange(r,14,1,2).setValues([['cancelled',now]]));[...new Set(rows.map(r=>String(v[r-1][2])))].forEach(id=>{try{syncParticipantViewerSheet_(id)}catch(error){console.error(error)}});return rows.length}
function installDailyTrigger_(){if(!ScriptApp.getProjectTriggers().some(t=>t.getHandlerFunction()==='cancelOverdueCampResponses'))ScriptApp.newTrigger('cancelOverdueCampResponses').timeBased().everyDays(1).atHour(1).create()}

/** Google Cloudを使わず、対象メールアドレスへ6桁コードを送信する。 */
function requestEmailLogin(rawEmail){const email=String(rawEmail||'').trim().toLowerCase();if(!/^[-+.\w]+@[-.\w]+$/.test(email))throw new Error('メールアドレスを正しく入力してください。');if(!email.endsWith('@stu.hosei.ac.jp')&&!isAdmin_(email))throw new Error('このメールアドレスは対象ではありません。大学メールまたは登録済み幹部メールを入力してください。');const cache=CacheService.getScriptCache(),key=authKey_(email),rateKey='login_rate:'+key;if(cache.get(rateKey))throw new Error('確認コードは送信済みです。1分ほど待ってから再送してください。');const code=String(Math.floor(100000+Math.random()*900000));cache.put('login_code:'+key,code,600);cache.put('login_attempts:'+key,'0',600);cache.put(rateKey,'1',60);MailApp.sendEmail({to:email,subject:'【法政大学写真研究会】ログイン確認コード',body:'統合活動ポータルのログイン確認コードは '+code+' です。\n\n有効期限は10分です。心当たりがない場合は、このメールを破棄してください。',name:'法政大学写真研究会'});return{ok:true,masked:maskEmail_(email),message:'確認コードを送信しました。'}}
function verifyEmailLogin(rawEmail,rawCode){const email=String(rawEmail||'').trim().toLowerCase(),code=String(rawCode||'').trim(),cache=CacheService.getScriptCache(),key=authKey_(email),saved=cache.get('login_code:'+key),attempts=Number(cache.get('login_attempts:'+key)||0);if(attempts>=5)throw new Error('入力回数の上限に達しました。新しいコードを発行してください。');if(!saved){throw new Error('確認コードの有効期限が切れました。新しいコードを発行してください。')}if(saved!==code){cache.put('login_attempts:'+key,String(attempts+1),600);throw new Error('確認コードが一致しません。')}cache.remove('login_code:'+key);cache.remove('login_attempts:'+key);const session=Utilities.getUuid()+Utilities.getUuid(),user={email,name:''};cache.put('app_session:'+session,JSON.stringify(user),21600);return{session,email,isAdmin:isAdmin_(email)}}
function getAuthContext(token){const user=authenticate_(token);return{email:user.email,name:user.name||'',isAdmin:isAdmin_(user.email)}}
function authenticate_(token){token=String(token||'').trim();if(!token)throw new Error('AUTH_REQUIRED: メール認証を行ってください。');const cached=CacheService.getScriptCache().get('app_session:'+token);if(!cached)throw new Error('AUTH_EXPIRED: ログインの有効期限が切れました。もう一度認証してください。');return JSON.parse(cached)}
function authKey_(email){return Utilities.base64EncodeWebSafe(Utilities.computeDigest(Utilities.DigestAlgorithm.SHA_256,String(email))).slice(0,60)}
function maskEmail_(email){const parts=email.split('@'),name=parts[0];return(name.length<=2?name[0]+'*':name.slice(0,2)+'***'+name.slice(-1))+'@'+parts[1]}
function validateEvent_(p,complete){if(!String(p.title||'').trim())throw new Error('予定名は必須です。');if(!['meeting','camp','exhibition'].includes(p.genre))throw new Error('ジャンルを選択してください。');if(p.genre==='meeting'&&!['shooting','dining'].includes(p.subtype))throw new Error('全体会の種別を選択してください。');if(!complete)return;if(!p.startAt||!p.place||!p.contact)throw new Error('日時・場所・連絡先は必須です。');if(p.genre==='camp'&&(!num_(p.fee)||!p.paymentDeadline))throw new Error('合宿では費用と支払期限が必須です。');if(p.genre==='exhibition'&&(!p.exhibitionTitle||!num_(p.maxWorks)||!(p.shiftSlots||[]).length||!num_(p.minShiftPeople)))throw new Error('写真展タイトル・作品数・シフト枠・最低人数は必須です。')}
function photo_(email,events){const ids=events.filter(e=>e.Genre==='exhibition').map(e=>e.EventId);if(!ids.length)return[];const works=objects_(sheet_('exhibitionDb','Exhibits')).filter(x=>ids.includes(x.EventId)&&String(x.Email).toLowerCase()===email),shifts=objects_(sheet_('exhibitionDb','Shifts')).filter(x=>ids.includes(x.EventId)&&String(x.Email).toLowerCase()===email);return ids.map(id=>({eventId:id,works:works.filter(x=>x.EventId===id),shifts:shifts.filter(x=>x.EventId===id)})).filter(x=>x.works.length||x.shifts.length)}
function responseSheet_(g){return g==='camp'?sheet_('campDb','Responses'):g==='exhibition'?sheet_('exhibitionDb','Responses'):sheet_('meetingDb','Responses')}
function getMemberEventResponses_(email,events){const result={},genres={};(events||[]).forEach(function(event){genres[event.Genre]=true;});Object.keys(genres).forEach(function(genre){objects_(responseSheet_(genre)).forEach(function(response){if(String(response.Email||'').trim().toLowerCase()===email)result[String(response.EventId)]=publicResponse_(response);});});return result}
function getMemberEventResponse_(email,event){return getMemberEventResponses_(email,[event])[String(event.EventId)]||null}
function publicResponse_(response){return{responseId:String(response.ResponseId||''),submittedAt:clientSafeValue_(response.SubmittedAt),attendance:String(response.Attendance||''),lineName:String(response.LineName||''),camera:bool_(response.Camera),disposableCamera:bool_(response.DisposableCamera),allergies:String(response.Allergies||''),otherAllergy:String(response.OtherAllergy||''),note:String(response.Note||''),agreement:bool_(response.Agreement),paymentStatus:String(response.PaymentStatus||''),cancelledAt:clientSafeValue_(response.CancelledAt)}}
function cameraCount_(id){return objects_(sheet_('meetingDb','Responses')).filter(r=>r.EventId===id&&bool_(r.Camera)&&!r.CancelledAt).length}
function findEvent_(id){const target=String(id||'').trim();return objects_(sheet_('settingsDb','Events')).find(e=>String(e.EventId||'').trim()===target)}
function findMember_(email){return objects_(sheet_('memberDb','Members')).find(m=>String(m.Email).toLowerCase()===email&&bool_(m.Active))}
function ensureMembershipYearsSheet_(){const ss=openBook_('memberDb');let s=ss.getSheetByName('MembershipYears');if(!s){s=ss.insertSheet('MembershipYears');s.getRange(1,1,1,APP.headers.MembershipYears.length).setValues([APP.headers.MembershipYears]).setFontWeight('bold');s.setFrozenRows(1)}return s}
function findMembership_(memberId,fiscalYear){return objects_(ensureMembershipYearsSheet_()).find(m=>String(m.MemberId)===String(memberId)&&Number(m.FiscalYear)===Number(fiscalYear)&&bool_(m.Active))||null}
function nextMemberId_(members){let max=0;(members||[]).forEach(m=>{const match=String(m.MemberId||'').match(/^member-(\d+)$/);if(match)max=Math.max(max,Number(match[1]))});return'member-'+String(max+1).padStart(4,'0')}
function currentFiscalYear_(){const now=new Date(),month=Number(Utilities.formatDate(now,Session.getScriptTimeZone(),'M'));return Number(Utilities.formatDate(now,Session.getScriptTimeZone(),'yyyy'))-(month<4?1:0)}
function publicMember_(m,membership){return m?{memberId:m.MemberId,email:m.Email,name:m.Name,faculty:m.Faculty,grade:m.Grade,department:m.Department,graduateSchool:m.GraduateSchool,major:m.Major,lineName:m.LineName,membership:membership?{fiscalYear:Number(membership.FiscalYear),joinedAt:clientSafeValue_(membership.JoinedAt),feeAmount:Number(membership.FeeAmount||0),active:bool_(membership.Active)}:null,currentFiscalYear:currentFiscalYear_()}:null}
function publicEvent_(e){return{id:e.EventId,genre:e.Genre,subtype:e.Subtype,title:e.Title,exhibitionTitle:e.ExhibitionTitle,startAt:clientSafeValue_(e.StartAt),endAt:clientSafeValue_(e.EndAt),place:e.Place,contact:e.Contact,details:e.Details,fee:e.Fee,paymentDeadline:clientSafeValue_(e.PaymentDeadline),maxWorks:e.MaxWorks,cameraEnabled:bool_(e.CameraEnabled),disposableEnabled:bool_(e.DisposableEnabled),shiftSlots:json_(e.ShiftSlotsJson,[]),minShiftPeople:e.MinShiftPeople}}
let runtimeConfigCache_=null,runtimeBookCache_={};
function config_(){if(runtimeConfigCache_)return runtimeConfigCache_;const r=PropertiesService.getScriptProperties().getProperty(APP.propertyKey);if(!r)throw new Error('初期設定がありません。setupIntegratedApp を実行してください。');runtimeConfigCache_=JSON.parse(r);return runtimeConfigCache_}
function openBook_(book){if(!runtimeBookCache_[book])runtimeBookCache_[book]=SpreadsheetApp.openById(config_().books[book]);return runtimeBookCache_[book]}
function sheet_(book,name){return openBook_(book).getSheetByName(name)}
function objects_(s){const v=s.getDataRange().getValues();if(v.length<2)return[];return v.slice(1).filter(r=>r.some(x=>x!=='')).map(r=>{const o={};v[0].forEach((h,i)=>o[h]=r[i]);return o})}
function isAdmin_(email){if(!email)return false;try{return objects_(sheet_('settingsDb','Admins')).some(a=>String(a.Email).toLowerCase()===email&&bool_(a.Active))}catch(e){return false}}
function assertAdmin_(token){const e=authenticate_(token).email;if(!isAdmin_(e))throw new Error('管理者権限がありません。');return e}
function email_(){return String(Session.getActiveUser().getEmail()||'').trim().toLowerCase()}
function url_(){return String(ScriptApp.getService().getUrl()||'').replace(/^https:\/\/script\.google\.com\/a\/macros\/[^/]+\/s\//,'https://script.google.com/macros/s/')}
function bool_(v){return v===true||['true','1','yes','on','参加'].includes(String(v||'').toLowerCase())}function num_(v){const n=Number(v);return isFinite(n)?n:0}function date_(v){return v?new Date(v):''}function json_(v,f){try{return JSON.parse(String(v||''))}catch(e){return f}}
function clientSafeValue_(value){return value instanceof Date?Utilities.formatDate(value,Session.getScriptTimeZone(),"yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ssXXX"):value}
function clientSafeObject_(object){const out={};Object.keys(object||{}).forEach(function(key){out[key]=clientSafeValue_(object[key]);});return out}
